    "long_instructions": "## Creating Functions\r\n\r\nConnect an inline event handler to a reusable, named arrow function. \r\n* **Test** the button and notice what changes in the output.\r\n* **Extract** the code inside the **anonymous function** into a **named arrow function** written above the listener.\r\n* **Hook it up:** In `addEventListener`, pass the **function reference** (no parentheses).\r\n* **Comment** your function.\r\n* **\r\nUse AI to Help You:\r\n* Explain what the current code does in plain language.\r\n* Walk you through the difference between a function reference and a function call.\r\n* Debug any errors you see after you make changes.\r\n* Suggest a clearer name for your function — but keep only what makes sense to you.\r\n* **\r\nCompare Your Functions to Ones Created By AI \r\n* Ask AI to create a function for the same task and compare your refactored function to one generated by AI. Which is clearer or easier to understand?",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <title>Say Hello (L4–L2)</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  <script defer src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <h1>Say Hello</h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\">Create a named arrow function and connect it to the button.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"container\">\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <button id=\"btnHello\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Say Hello</button>\n      <div id=\"output\" class=\"output\"></div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <small>Creating Functions</small>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "/* Base */\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\", Arial, sans-serif;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: #0f172a;        /* slate-900 */\n  background: #f6fffb;  /* very light mint */\n}\n\n.site-header {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 20px 12px;\n  background: #e6f7f3;  /* pale teal band */\n}\n\n.site-header h1 {\n  margin: 6px 0;\n  color: #0b7a70;       /* deep teal */\n}\n\n.lede {\n  margin: 0;\n  color: #0f766e;       /* teal-700 */\n}\n\n.container {\n  max-width: 700px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid #dbe9e5; /* soft teal-gray */\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  padding: 18px;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: 10px 16px;\n  border: 1px solid #a7d8cf;  /* mid teal border */\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  background: #e9fbf6;        /* light mint */\n  color: #0b7a70;\n}\n\n.btn-primary {\n  background: #c9f0e8;        /* slightly stronger mint */\n  border-color: #0f766e;\n  color: #075e56;\n}\n\n.btn:hover {\n  background: #d8f6ee;        /* subtle hover */\n}\n\n.output {\n  margin-top: 12px;\n  border: 1px dashed #a7d8cf;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  background: #f2fffb;        /* near-white mint */\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  min-height: 32px;\n  font-size: 18px;\n}\n\n.site-footer {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 20px 12px;\n  color: #0f766e;\n}\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "// — Element references \nconst btn = document.getElementById(\"btnHello\");\nconst output = document.getElementById(\"output\");\n\n// — Current behavior \nbtn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n  output.textContent = \"Hello!\";\n});\n\n\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "3"
      ]
    },
